    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_89e82ee2a37bf4ce1d85",
      "document_start": 203,
      "document_end": 240,
      "text": "对于低速运动的实际工程对象，其零部件的弹性变形并不影响其大范围的运动性态。",
      "section_id": "section_e0198b06f0b8"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_22ab2c36086f28f0857e",
      "document_start": 240,
      "document_end": 260,
      "text": "在这种情况下，系统中的物体可作刚体假定。",
      "section_id": "section_e0198b06f0b8"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_eac64fe544f665939040",
      "document_start": 260,
      "document_end": 275,
      "text": "这样的多体系统称为多刚体系统。",
      "section_id": "section_e0198b06f0b8"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_c759ae510bb8afd9ab68",
      "document_start": 275,
      "document_end": 340,
      "text": "由于大型、轻质机械系统的出现，高速运行的工况将使系统动力学性态越来越复杂，这些现象由于零部件的大范围运动与构件的弹性变形耦合引起。",
      "section_id": "section_e0198b06f0b8"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_874af75112da53a218a1",
      "document_start": 340,
      "document_end": 363,
      "text": "在分析这类系统动力学时，物体必须作柔性体假定。",
      "section_id": "section_e0198b06f0b8"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8fb134002241f14c54ff",
      "document_start": 363,
      "document_end": 378,
      "text": "这类力学模型称为柔性多体系统。",
      "section_id": "section_e0198b06f0b8"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7fb6c8087efc36f42890",
      "document_start": 378,
      "document_end": 429,
      "text": "如果上述系统中部分物体仍可作刚体假定，则构成的力学模型为刚一柔混合多体系统，它是多系统中最一般的模型。",
      "section_id": "section_e0198b06f0b8"
    }
